This HTML code creates a faithful, self-contained reproduction of the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Astrans" (a fictional name for this exercise) within a single file. It includes the original rules, sprite designs, and mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>1978 Taito Arcade – Astrans</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background: #111;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    }
    .cabinet {
      background: #222;
      border: 6px solid #8b5a2b;
      border-radius: 20px 20px 10px 10px;
      padding: 20px 30px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 200, 50, 0.2);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .marquee {
      background: #1a1a2e;
      color: #f0c060;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #f0c060, 0 0 20px #ff8c00;
      padding: 10px 30px;
      border: 3px solid #b8860b;
      border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .screen-wrapper {
      background: #000;
      border: 6px solid #333;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px;
      margin: 5px 0;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #000, 0 0 10px #f0c06040;
    }
    canvas {
      display: block;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      width: 640px;
      height: 480px;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      border: 2px solid #5a3e1a;
    }
    .controls {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      color: #ddd;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      background: #2b1a0e;
      padding: 10px 30px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #b8860b;
    }
    .controls span {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .key {
      background: #444;
      border: 2px solid #888;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 2px 10px;
      color: #ffd966;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #c8411a;
      border: 3px solid #ff6e1e;
      border-radius: 50%;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff6e1e80;
    }
